        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P20",
      "text": [
        "A question has a document",
        "Who must file: the Form 1040 instructions for that year.",
        "What is the standard deduction: the IRS inflation release for that year, and those same instructions.",
        "How do I file for free: the IRS Free File page for that season."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P30"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P10"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P30",
      "text": [
        "You are not hunting a blog",
        "A blog can point you at the document.",
        "The document is the thing you read before you type a number."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P40"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P20"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P40",
      "text": [
        "Check",
        "You need the standard deduction for the year on your form. What kind of page answers it?"
      ],
      "quiz": {
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "The IRS inflation release for that year, and that year's Form 1040 instructions.",
            "correct": true
          },
          {
            "label": "The first ad in a search.",
            "correct": false
          },
          {
            "label": "A forum thread.",
            "correct": false
          }
        ],
        "again": "P0",
        "next": "P50"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P50",
      "text": [
        "Match the year",
        "The form, the instructions, and the news release have to be the same year.",
        "A 2026 Form 1040 uses the 2026 instructions.",
        "IR-2025-103 is the release that published the tax year 2026 amounts."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P60"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P40"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P60",
      "text": [
        "Filing season is not the tax year",
        "The 2026 filing season accepted 2025 returns.",
        "Tax year 2026 is the return you file in 2027.",
        "The corner of the form is how you tell them apart."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P70"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P50"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P70",
      "text": [
        "Say it in one sentence",
        "I am filing the return whose year is printed on the form, and I am reading the instructions with that same year."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P80"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P60"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P80",
      "text": [
        "Check",
        "It is January 2027 and you are filing. Which form?"
      ],
      "quiz": {
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "The Form 1040 that says 2026.",
            "correct": true
          },
          {
            "label": "The Form 1040 that says 2027, because that is the calendar year.",
            "correct": false
          },
          {
            "label": "Whichever PDF is easiest to download.",
            "correct": false
          }
        ],
        "again": "P50",
        "next": "P90"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P90",
      "text": [
        "The site",
        "The forms, the instructions, and Free File are on IRS.gov.",
        "The free-file door is IRS.gov/freefile."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P100"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P80"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P100",
      "text": [
        "A look-alike is not the door",
        "A site that looks like the IRS and sells a return is not the free offer.",
        "You get to Free File by starting on IRS.gov."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P110"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P90"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P110",
      "text": [
        "Search from there",
        "On IRS.gov, search the form number and the year.",
        "Form 1040, instructions, 2026.",
        "The PDF that opens should show that year."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P120"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P100"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P120",
      "text": [
        "Check",
        "You want the IRS free software. Where do you begin?"
      ],
      "quiz": {
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "IRS.gov/freefile.",
            "correct": true
          },
          {
            "label": "A company's home page that says free.",
            "correct": false
          },
          {
            "label": "A search ad.",
            "correct": false
          }
        ],
        "again": "P90",
        "next": "P130"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P130",
      "text": [
        "The form",
        "Form 1040 is the return.",
        "The lines are the blanks you fill."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P140"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P120"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P140",
      "text": [
        "The instructions",
        "The instructions for that form, same year, tell you what each line means.",
        "Who must file is a section in those instructions."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P150"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P130"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P150",
      "text": [
        "The news release",
        "IR-2025-103 is the short IRS announcement of the tax year 2026 amounts.",
        "It names Revenue Procedure 2025-32 for the full table."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P160"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P140"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P160",
      "text": [
        "The revenue procedure",
        "That is the table.",
        "You open it when the news release is not specific enough."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P170"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P150"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P170",
      "text": [
        "Use them in that order",
        "Line on the form, then the instruction for the line, then the release or the procedure if the instruction sends you to the year's dollar amount."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P180"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P160"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P180",
      "text": [
        "Check",
        "You know the line, and you need to know what the line means. What do you open?"
      ],
      "quiz": {
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "The instructions for that form and year.",
            "correct": true
          },
          {
            "label": "The revenue procedure, first, always.",
            "correct": false
          },
          {
            "label": "A video.",
            "correct": false
          }
        ],
        "again": "P130",
        "next": "P190"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P190",
      "text": [
        "The government already does this",
        "You do not have to pay a brand name to file a normal return.",
        "The IRS runs Free File, Fillable Forms, and the volunteer programs."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P200"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P180"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P200",
      "text": [
        "Guided software",
        "Free File guided software is for people under the income the IRS prints for that season.",
        "For the season that filed 2025 returns, that line was adjusted gross income of $89,000 or less.",
        "The page for the season you are filing prints the line that applies then."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P210"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P190"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P210",
      "text": [
        "Fillable Forms",
        "Free File Fillable Forms are free at any income.",
        "You are doing the form yourself, with the instructions."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P220"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P200"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P220",
      "text": [
        "Volunteers and the military",
        "VITA and TCE are volunteer preparers.",
        "MilTax is the military community's free file.",
        "The season announcement on IRS.gov names them."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P230"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P210"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P230",
      "text": [
        "TaxSlayer, if you just want it done",
        "A normal W-2 return can be done at taxslayer.com.",
        "That is a product, and it is enough.",
        "It is not the same door as IRS Free File unless the IRS page lists it as a partner for that season."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P240"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P220"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P240",
      "text": [
        "TurboTax is optional",
        "Nothing on the return requires TurboTax, H&R Block, or any other paid brand.",
        "Paying more does not change the W-2."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P250"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P230"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P250",
      "text": [
        "Check",
        "Your adjusted gross income is over the Free File guided limit printed for this season. What is still free?"
      ],
      "quiz": {
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "IRS Free File Fillable Forms.",
            "correct": true
          },
          {
            "label": "Nothing. You must buy TurboTax.",
            "correct": false
          },
          {
            "label": "Direct File, because it is always open.",
            "correct": false
          }
        ],
        "again": "P190",
        "next": "P260"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P260",
      "text": [
        "A draft is marked",
        "The IRS sometimes posts a draft of next year's form.",
        "The 2026 Form 1040 had a draft up in September 2026.",
        "The draft says it is not for filing."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P270"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P250"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P270",
      "text": [
        "Wait for the final",
        "You file the final form for that year.",
        "The instructions you use are the final instructions."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P280"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P260"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P280",
      "text": [
        "Check",
        "The PDF says DRAFT and not for filing. What do you do with it?"
      ],
      "quiz": {
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "You do not file it. You get the final form.",
            "correct": true
          },
          {
            "label": "You file it, because a draft is close enough.",
            "correct": false
          },
          {
            "label": "You use last year's form instead.",
            "correct": false
          }
        ],
        "again": "P260",
        "next": "P290"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P290",
      "text": [
        "The question",
        "What is the standard deduction on a 2026 return for a single person under 65?"
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P300"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P280"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P300",
      "text": [
        "The path",
        "Open IR-2025-103, or Revenue Procedure 2025-32.",
        "Or open the 2026 Form 1040 instructions and read the standard deduction section.",
        "Either one is the IRS. A blog that repeats the number is not the source."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P310"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P290"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P310",
      "text": [
        "The amount",
        "Single: $16,100.",
        "Married filing jointly: $32,200.",
        "Head of household: $24,150."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P320"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P300"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P320",
      "text": [
        "Check",
        "You found $16,100 on a blog and nowhere else. What do you do?"
      ],
      "quiz": {
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "Confirm it in IR-2025-103 or the 2026 instructions before you use it.",
            "correct": true
          },
          {
            "label": "Type it. A blog is enough.",
            "correct": false
          },
          {
            "label": "Use the 2025 amount instead, to be safe.",
            "correct": false
          }
        ],
        "again": "P290",
        "next": "P330"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P330",
      "text": [
        "The question",
        "Do I have to file the 2026 return?"
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P340"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P320"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P340",
      "text": [
        "The path",
        "Open the 2026 Form 1040 instructions.",
        "Find who must file.",
        "Compare your gross income to the standard deduction for your status, and check the self-employment test."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P350"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P330"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P350",
      "text": [
        "The tests you already know",
        "Under 65, the threshold is the standard deduction: $16,100, $32,200, or $24,150.",
        "Net self-employment of $400 or more: file.",
        "Married filing separately: the instructions' $5 test."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P360"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P340"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P360",
      "text": [
        "Check",
        "Where is the who-must-file test written?"
      ],
      "quiz": {
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "In the 2026 Form 1040 instructions.",
            "correct": true
          },
          {
            "label": "Only in TaxSlayer.",
            "correct": false
          },
          {
            "label": "It is different in every state, so the federal form does not say.",
            "correct": false
          }
        ],
        "again": "P330",
        "next": "P370"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P370",
      "text": [
        "Open the page, then read it",
        "Go to IRS.gov/freefile.",
        "The page names the season and the income line for guided software."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P380"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P360"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P380",
      "text": [
        "The 2026 season, as an example of reading it",
        "That season filed 2025 returns.",
        "Guided software was for adjusted gross income of $89,000 or less.",
        "The IRS listed eight partners. You use the list on the page, not a list you remember."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P390"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P370"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P390",
      "text": [
        "Partners set their own extra rules",
        "A partner can limit by age, state, or military status.",
        "The IRS page says so.",
        "If one partner says no, you pick another partner from that page."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P400"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P380"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P400",
      "text": [
        "Fillable Forms do not use that income line",
        "They are on the same IRS Free File area.",
        "Any income. You follow the instructions."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P410"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P390"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P410",
      "text": [
        "Check",
        "A partner's own website says you do not qualify for the free offer. What do you do?"
      ],
      "quiz": {
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "Go back to IRS.gov/freefile and pick another partner on the IRS list.",
            "correct": true
          },
          {
            "label": "Buy TurboTax.",
            "correct": false
          },
          {
            "label": "Use the partner's paid product, because the IRS said to.",
            "correct": false
          }
        ],
        "again": "P370",
        "next": "P420"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P420",
      "text": [
        "The interview is not the law",
        "TaxSlayer asks questions and fills the form.",
        "The form and the instructions are still the return."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P430"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P410"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
          "page": "P10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P430",
      "text": [
        "When an answer looks wrong",
        "Open the 2026 instructions for that line.",
        "If the software and the instructions disagree, the instructions win.",
        "You can also open the form and see what it typed."
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Next",
          "page": "P440"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "page": "P420"
        },
        {
          "label": "Menu",
